<title>UK: Equitable Life planning 350 mln stg perpetual bond.</title>
<headline>Equitable Life planning 350 mln stg perpetual bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equitable Life Assurance Society is planning to launch a 350 million stg perpetual bond issue in the near future, subject to market conditions, ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and J.P. Morgan Securities said on Thursday as joint lead managers.</p>
<p>The deal, which will be callable after 10 years, will have a step-up coupon structure. No other details were announced.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
